      "id": "claim_35a92414d6744a4b94ea8a73aec5a531",
      "statement": "The Pandera contract (credit_schema) constrains seven Home Credit feature columns (unique non-null SK_ID_CURR, positive income and credit, nullable positive annuity, DAYS_BIRTH <= -6575, non-negative children, non-null income type string) and adds a TARGET in {0,1} only in training mode; it uses strict=False, coerce=False, and both validators run with lazy=True so all violations are raised together as SchemaErrors.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/data/contracts.py#L6-L51",
